# Asura OS Udev Power Rules

# Automatically switches system power profiles and manages NVIDIA dGPU D3cold state.

# 1. AC Adapter status changes (restricted to Mains/AC wall power, ignoring wireless peripherals)
SUBSYSTEM=="power_supply", ATTR{type}=="Mains", ATTR{online}=="1", RUN+="/usr/bin/asura power ac"
SUBSYSTEM=="power_supply", ATTR{type}=="Mains", ATTR{online}=="0", RUN+="/usr/bin/asura power bat"

# 2. NVIDIA PCIe Runtime Power Management is owned by 80-nvidia-pm.rules
# (bind-time, TEST=="power/control"). Not duplicated here.
